Icon: file:///var/jb/Library/TikTokX/icon.png
Description: Background play, auto scroll and lock screen controls for TikTok
 TikTokX adds five features to TikTok, each with its own switch in Settings:
 .
 - Background Play: keep audio playing when you leave TikTok or lock the screen.
 - Auto Scroll: move to the next video when the current one finishes.
 - Skip -> Next/Previous: replace the 15s skip buttons on the lock screen and
   Control Center with previous/next to scroll the feed.
 - Clear Display: hide the buttons, caption and overlays on videos;
   tap the video to show them for 3 seconds.
 - Car Screen Zoom: on a car display (CarBridge), fill the wide screen and
   zoom portrait videos in a little.
 .
 Settings are in English or Vietnamese. Requires Dopamine (rootless).
